      "type": "mcq",
      "question": "Aldrin starts from his house to his office on motorcycle daily at a fixed time. If he covers this distance at 20 km/h, he is late by 8 minutes. However, if he covers this distance at 24 km/h, he arrives early by 5 minutes. The distance between his house and his office is",
