        "26 km"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 3,
      "answerSource": "derived",
      "answerKeyRef": null,
      "explanation": "The difference in journey time is 8 minutes late plus 5 minutes early = 13 minutes. If the distance is d km, d/20 − d/24 = 13/60 hours. Since 1/20−1/24 = 1/120, d = 26 km. Verified solution (unofficial); original printed paper and worked derivation checked on 26 October 2026.",
